[02:31.30] I am for a life around the corner
[02:36.41] That takes you by surprise
[02:40.73] That comes leaves all you need
[02:44.12] And more besides
[02:48.40] I am for a life and time by numbers
[02:53.89] Blast in fast 'n' low
[02:57.36] Add 'em up, account for luck
[03:01.67] You never know
[03:04.65] I am into friendship and plain sailing
[03:09.71] Through frenzied ports o' call
[03:13.67] O shake the hand to beat the band
[03:17.92] With love is all
[03:20.92] Or nothing to the man who wants tomorrow
[03:26.05] There's one in every town
[03:30.45] A crazy guy, he'd rather die
[03:35.01] Than be tied down
[03:37.46] I am for the man who drives the hammer
[03:42.88] To rock you 'til the grave
[03:47.34] His power drill shocks
[03:50.76] A million miles away
[03:54.85] I am for the revolution's coming
[03:59.49] I don't know where she's been
[04:04.03] For those who dare because it's there
[04:08.66] I know I've seen
[04:11.58] Now and then I've suffered imperfection
[04:16.05] I've studied marble flaws
[04:21.16] And faces drawn pale and worn
[04:25.51] By many tears
[04:28.17] I am that I am from out of nowhere
[04:33.04] To fight without a cause
[04:37.61] Roots strain against the grain
[04:42.08] With brute force you'd better
[04:46.85] Hold out when you're in doubt
[04:49.83] Question what you see
[04:54.50] And when you find an answer
[04:58.85] Bring it home to me.
[05:05.11] 